      "comment": "I checked the order of the 12 research items and found that the overall sequence is reasonable, beginning with church and census records before moving to marriage and probate records. However, the 1850 census neighbor search (pli_012) should come before the probate search (pli_011), since it offers another useful FAN research opportunity before the more time-consuming browse-only probate search. The plan also needs clearer sequencing where searches depend on information identified in earlier records. The research coverage is good, but the ordering could be improved."
